{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dust Busters</strong> is a cooperative online cleaning game for 1 to 4 players. Build your own cleaning company from scratch and take on the toughest and strangest jobs to escape the claws of Clean Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your mops, buckets, and aprons\u2014you're about to explore strange and challenging places, facing terrible dangers (and even your own teammates!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a <strong>Master Cleaner</strong>, a successful business owner, your teammates\u2019 worst nightmare\u2026 or all at once! Upgrade your skills, unlock new tools, grow your office, and clean up your image as much as you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online Co-op!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a cooperative experience as a solo employee or with up to three colleagues! Test your teamwork, communication, and adaptability as you try to finish the job on time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855180/extras/43f2efb00435c5c6aa905e8292f88cea.poster.avif?t=1761720979\" width=780 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855180/extras/43f2efb00435c5c6aa905e8292f88cea.webm?t=1761720979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855180/extras/43f2efb00435c5c6aa905e8292f88cea.mp4?t=1761720979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Challenges!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your business grows, your clients will get stranger and more demanding. Face all kinds of dangers and surprises\u2014and take your company to the top!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Suit up and get to work!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all kinds of cosmetics, customize your character and your teammates. Show off your best uniforms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even your office can be customized!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855180/extras/637c331705061c2074e5f1a9dbe3ae93.poster.avif?t=1761720979\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855180/extras/637c331705061c2074e5f1a9dbe3ae93.webm?t=1761720979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855180/extras/637c331705061c2074e5f1a9dbe3ae93.mp4?t=1761720979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855180?t=1761720979","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855180/6a6c42e49411f5e4a5b84b3f10755bb35f1defde/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761720979","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855180/4a9a5b733b4063dec7a824417c7611a6d3fa04c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761720979","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855180/4a9a5b733b4063dec7a824417c7611a6d3fa04c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761720979","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dust Busters</strong> is a cooperative online cleaning game for 1 to 4 players. Build